{"articleNo":"1472","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1472&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010년도 동계 중소기업체험학습사업 참여학생 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.11.10","hit":"10136","attachments":[{"name":"중활모집공고(학생용)-2010동계.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1472&attachNo=70158"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 90%\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1. 사 업 명 :『2010년도 동계 대학생 혁신형중소기업 현장연수프로그램』</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;2. 사업목적 : 대학생의 중소기업에 대한 인식을 개선하여 중소기업으로의 인력 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;유입을 위한 기반을 조성</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;3. 기간 : 2010년 12월 27일(월)~ 2011년 2월 25일(금)(동계방학 기간중)&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 4주간 근무</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;4. 참여대상 : 본교 공학부 대학생&nbsp; 29명 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 이학 및 공학분야</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 84%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 84%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">신청제한 : 현재 대학 4학년은 신청할 수 없음 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;5. 연수기업 : 경북지역소재의 중소제조기업(이노비즈, 벤처인증기업 및 업체&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 종업원 50인이상 또는 매출액 100억원이상&nbsp; 규모의 중소기업)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 연수기업 소재 지역&nbsp; : 경북 구미권, 칠곡군등 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">6. 참여학생 연수방법 및 내용 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 연수업체는 회사 상황에 따라 1～10명을 연수시키며, 사내 지도위원&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(Mentor)을 정하여&nbsp; 연수기간 동안 대학생을 지도 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 연수는 생산현장, 연구개발, 신제품개발, 디자인개선 등 프로젝트 수행, </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;부서별 순환연수 등 중소기업을 이해할 수 있도록 진행</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;7. 지원 내용 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp; 참여대학생에게는 40만원/인 수당 정부지원 (상황에 따라 기업체 별도</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;수당 지급가능)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp; 2학점 부여 및 위험 보장보험 가입 지원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp; 중소기업청장 명의의 참여확인증서 수여</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp; 연수 완료 후 소정의 기념품 지급</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(신청안내)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;1. 신청기한 : 2010. 11. 10(수) ~ 2010. 12. 9(목) 16:00까지 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 신청방법 : 신청서를 작성하여 희망학생은 신청서를 금오공과대학교&nbsp;<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 중소기업산학협력센터</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(이오스관 315호)로 직접 방문 기한내 제출&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 문 의 처 : 중소기업산학협력센터 (☎ 478-7234 담당 유광희, 배재춘)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(선정조건)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 109%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 109%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 109%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 109%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 지원신청서 내용 심사&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 109%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 109%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 109%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 109%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 109%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">업체 및 학생간의 기술분야 매치 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 109%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 109%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;3. 방학중 거주지가 기업체에 출퇴근이 원활한 거리 및 불편이 없는 경우&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\">금오공과대학교 중소기업산학협력센터 소장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
